<title>JAPAN: BOT-Mitsubishi 6mth prnt results.</title>
<headline>BOT-Mitsubishi 6mth prnt results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Revenues	     2.32 trln	 vs	    2.40 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  222.68		vs	  336.37</p>
<p> Current	     56.27		vs	   94.79</p>
<p> Net		   24.47		vs	   35.14</p>
<p> EPS		    5.30 yen	  vs	    7.15 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   4.66 billion	  vs	4.92 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  4.25 yen	  vs	    4.25 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi Ltd is a major bank resulting from the merger of former Bank of Tokyo Ltd and former Mitsubishi Bank Ltd, as of April 1, 1996.</p>
</text>
